# AI Hacker rules

- Keep AI Hacker execution inside its own security domain and authorisation model.
- Require explicit scope and approval for any material action.
- Never grant unrestricted network, shell, or exploitation access.
- Use controlled execution, evidence capture, and reviewable output.
- Do not inherit Business Partner financial or commercial permissions.
- Keep testing and reporting within the approved security-use lifecycle.
